    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amazing Frog?  is like a kid-friendly version of &quot;Grand Theft Auto&quot; with action-packed chaos and toadally potty humour. Parkour through the town inspired by Swindon, United Kingdom as a ridiculous, farting ragdoll frog. Fly beyond the walls to uncover the many mysteries of Swindonshire! Start the fun in single player or up to four player split-screen co-op! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5af9e3a7e35483f1e703797ce9c0727d.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5af9e3a7e35483f1e703797ce9c0727d.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/5af9e3a7e35483f1e703797ce9c0727d.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Start your Quest to unlock the Magical Mystery Toilet!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump around town:</strong> Bounce on trampolines, soar through the air with cannons and explore every nook and cranny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock Exciting Rewards:</strong> Collect new gear and equipment to help traverse Swindonshire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find new costumes</strong>: Use brown portaloos to discover new outfits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dress to impress:</strong> Customize your frog in the hideout\u2019s blue portaloos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Will you be a good Swindon Citizen?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do Good Deeds! Rescue cute kittens, tidy up the town and defeat zombies to earn<strong> Swindon Citizen Points (SCP)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/efc2b8ae4812409358839af3bec55c35.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/efc2b8ae4812409358839af3bec55c35.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/efc2b8ae4812409358839af3bec55c35.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Or Bring Chaos?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cause explosions while jumping, driving or using bombs! Shoot guns, start chaos and spread mayhem! Terrorize the citizens of Swindonshire! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/bc5c7c818537033b44fdf89016fa2c40.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/bc5c7c818537033b44fdf89016fa2c40.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/bc5c7c818537033b44fdf89016fa2c40.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Action Adventure Awaits!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Driving:</strong> Test your skills with various vehicles like cars, trucks, buggies, bikes, tractors, mopeds, and mobility scooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Flying:</strong> Take to the skies with jets, airplanes, helicopters, drones, and jetpacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Ride the Waves:</strong> Find airboats, jet skis, and boats to explore the surrounding waters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/70468765e8bff2449c67a0b82e7a3c83.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/70468765e8bff2449c67a0b82e7a3c83.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/70468765e8bff2449c67a0b82e7a3c83.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight for survival!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swindonshire is home to tons of enemies like zombies, sharks, alligators and skeletons! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons:</strong> Use a wide range of weapons including pistols, bombs, poop guns, and grapple hooks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Melee Combat:</strong> Engage in hand-to-hand combat with swords, bats, fish, and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explosives:</strong> Use bombs, explosive barrels, and RPGs for max damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destructive vehicles:</strong>  Find tanks and RPGs as well as helicopters and drones with mounted guns! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8b6849f35f2631e093df86f2fe0da396.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8b6849f35f2631e093df86f2fe0da396.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/8b6849f35f2631e093df86f2fe0da396.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It\u2019s a big world out there</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover environmental landmarks around Swindonshire like the Mountain, Swindon-on-Sea and an island with aggressive inhabitants! Get to the church and ring in a zombie apocalypse! Approach the Army base and get into battle with elite, fighting frogs!  Find train tracks and stations to ride the Steam Trains! (Or you could derail them). Travel to Farm and meet the farmers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spawn Anywhere!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter orange portaloos to respawn back into if you die. Use the <strong>Spawn Point App</strong> in the fPhone to teleport back to every spawn point you have found! The app can even allow you to travel between different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/baa3503faede0b28685ad2542370e7f7.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/baa3503faede0b28685ad2542370e7f7.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/baa3503faede0b28685ad2542370e7f7.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover New Worlds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Look for secret entrances to alternative versions of Swindon like the wintery Snow World and the terrifying hellscape of Blood World. Fly helicopters in Flight School and unlock the jets! Trudge through the treacherous underground sewer and reignite the abandoned <strong>Swindon Space Program</strong>. Take a rocket to the Moon and explore the lunar landscape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/e7bcfa23ec6f163a4c35129bcc40e364.poster.avif?t=1748881133\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/e7bcfa23ec6f163a4c35129bcc40e364.webm?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/332570/extras/e7bcfa23ec6f163a4c35129bcc40e364.mp4?t=1748881133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play the main game of Amazing Frog? with up to four player local split screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play single player or with friends in <strong>Party Mode</strong>. Fight enemies that spawn in the forest maps! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with the limits of what's possible with the physics simulator. Mess around with jet packs, grapple hook, objects as well as the inhabitants of Swindon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find costumes across the map and customise your Frog!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items like berries, sandwiches, ammo, skulls, mushrooms, poop. (They will be useful soon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break out the Crown and start a violent coronation!</p></li></ul>",
